		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010030e"},
		line=1191,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Sunday evening, just past ten of the clock.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Akari and I step outside to find Kotone waiting for us.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, I will be in your care today.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"She looks rather nervous.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry for calling you out this late. Is everything all right with the Imperial Temple?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes. I snuck out, so everything is fine.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Snuck out!?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah! I mean, I informed them well in advance of my plans.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Kotone frantically goes on damage control.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's the bag for?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"She points at the bag on Kotone's back.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is a collapsible altar. I will need it for the memorial service.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Umm, will Hotori-sama not be joining us?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She has reasons she can't be here.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She says she hopes the memorial service will be an impressive one.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, absolutely, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Hotori is sitting this out in consideration of her position within the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Entry into the ruins of the Warrior District is strictly prohibited. If we get caught, our lives may be forfeit.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"It would be too dangerous for the acting chairman to come along with us.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now then, let's be off.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"We take a streetcar to Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"From here, we'll cut across to the riverbank, where we'll cross the river into the Warrior District.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This place sure is bustling.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have never seen anything like it...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Their eyes go wide at the spectacle of Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The frenzied fervor of storefronts blots out anything resembling order.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Like the heads of a hydra, the queer atmosphere of the district extends throughout each of its crooked alleyways.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"This is clearly no place for a pair of wide-eyed maidens.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I quickly move them along.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There isn't a single thing under the sun you couldn't buy here. As long as you don't ask too many questions, that is.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They've even got plenty of trinkets and spellblades that they picked up from the Warrior District.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They're looters?! Unbelievable!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Akari makes her anger apparent.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"From the warriors' point of view, the heirlooms of our families and friends are being peddled off without permission.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"It truly is an outrage, but these folks are just desperately trying to get by.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"The only thing worthy of blame is Okonogi's tyrannical regime.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"We emerge from Yogarasu District and reach the riverbank.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Sprawling across the river in jet black relief is the Warrior District─the place the warriors lived until three years ago.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"This vast river island was sealed off by the Republic immediately after the occupation, and even now, only military personnel are permitted entry.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"I can see the roofs of military installations dotting the center of the district, but the rest of the area is an overgrown grassland.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The early spring grass is still reddish-brown, but by midsummer, the whole area will be covered in weeds as tall as grown men.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"The remains of the warriors and their families sleep there even now.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The river is close to a hundred meters wide.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Steep cliffs perpendicular to the riverbed face us from the opposite shore, with a chain-link fence stretched across them for good measure.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"What's more, the bridges leading to neighboring districts are monitored twenty-four hours a day.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Umm, sir? You would not be proposing a cold swim by any chance, would you?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'd be shot dead if we took our sweet time swimming across.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then what's the plan? A boat?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We jump.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That made sense to you?!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This raiment is an Artifact.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It shows a bit too much skin for my liking, but it does let me move almost as a warrior can.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Akari declares, slightly lifting the hem of her skirt.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-Inconceivable...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If that is truly the case, it must be worth a vast... No, it would be beyond any price indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How many priestesses must have given their lives to create this?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Kotone stares at Akari's raiment with awe in her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Think you can give it an appraisal afterwards?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's supposedly a family heirloom, but the problem is, I\ndon't know where it came from.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am most interested myself, so it would be my absolute pleasure.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Kotone immediately begins prodding at Akari's clothes, muttering to herself all the while.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"If the appraisal produces the verdict we're looking for, we can use it to prove Akari's lineage.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's get back to going over the plan.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In about ten minutes, a transport barge will be coming up the river.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we use it as a stepping stone, it should be relatively easy to make the jump to the other side.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As long as we can make it past the fence, there'll hardly be any security to worry about.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Akari looks uneasy.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, will you be fine with your wounds? If you need me to, I can carry you.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's fine. I can handle this much.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If it starts hurting, I'll have you carry me on the way back.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Judging by her expression, I have nothing to worry about.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"As for our other accomplice...",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“U-Umm, I am afraid that the running long jump is not exactly my specialty...”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was planning on carrying you from the start.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whew, what a relief!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hold on... Should that really be a relief?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"At last, the barge comes into view from upstream.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"It's loaded with freight containers, perfect for serving as a flat jumping-off point.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, it's time.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wa-Waaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I place Kotone on my back.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-This position is rather─”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Lucky you, Kotone. Getting a piggyback ride from Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Well, yes, but... I never imagined it'd be while leaping across a river...”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Close your eyes. Try to not bite your tongue off.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Bobbing her head in assent, Kotone quickly squeezes her eyes and mouth shut.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right, I'll go first.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"I take a running start and set my sights on the barge.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huuup!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hweeeehhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I leap with all my might.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"I land on the barge for a split second and immediately leap again.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hyaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"We clear the fence and land among the grass of the Warrior District.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"I check behind me to see Akari about to make her second jump.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"The moment she gets her running start atop the freight containers, the hull of the barge tilts sharply.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Akari?!)”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"I soundlessly let out a yell.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"But in spite of the unsteadiness, Akari manages a clean jump.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"She lands right beside me and gracefully breaks her fall.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, that was incredible!”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Told you I was no slouch, didn't I?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"She gleefully stand up and begins brushing the dust off her clothes.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Excellent. Our infiltration went off without a hitch.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"A strong gust of wind blows past, rustling the grass around us.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Like a candle being blown out, all is stillness in its wake.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"No matter how much I try to ignore it, the smell of burning perfuses my nostrils.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Three years ago, countless warriors and their families lived out their ordinary days in this place, before it was all reduced to ash in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"All that remains is a land of the dead.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"The silence presses down on me with terrifying weight.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is as though the wind itself is weeping.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Kotone stares vacantly into the unending fields of overgrown grass.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where will you carry out the memorial ceremony?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If possible, I would like to head to the center of the district...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That'd involve walking headfirst into a military installation.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In that case, what about Hotori-sama's family home?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good idea. I'm sure she'd appreciate that.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"If the Warrior District was the face of a clock, then the Republican military installations would be dead in the center.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Wide roads extend out from there in the twelve, three, and nine o'clock directions, ending in bridges leading to neighboring districts.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"The rest of the district was left in ruins and is now slowly being reclaimed by nature.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"For what it's worth, we're currently at approximately seven\no'clock.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Hotori's house is about two hundred meters northeast of where we are.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"I lower my stance and silently creep forward.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"The grass is so tall that I can't even see my own two feet.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"I support Kotone as she's about to fall.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you okay?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My apologies. I lost my balance.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Kotone looks down at her feet.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? What... is this...”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Kotone freezes in place.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Her gaze is fixed down at a human skull, crudely split in two.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They really were just all left behind like this...”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. What a cruel fate...”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Someday, when the Empire is back to its former self, I'll come back to collect all these remains.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"And then I'll have Kotone give them a proper burial.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's keep moving.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I press onward, giving encouragement to the two girls\nwho'd fallen silent.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"After a while, we arrive at our destination.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This here was House Inou. The house to the right was ours, House Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's even more weathered than when I last came here.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Only the faintest traces of the former buildings remain in the sprawling grass before us.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"The remnants of the Inou manor and its immense dojo─the Myougikan.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mind if I go take a look?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Go ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"I leave the two behind and walk around the remains of House Tokita.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"It's a much smaller manor than House Inou.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Apparently, I once lived here with my adoptive parents, my sister, and a handful of servants.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"It's the third time I've been back here, but I still don't remember anything.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Any decent person would surely feel some sort of emotion in a place like this.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"I bump into a small object with my toes.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"It's a lady's comb.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"I pick it up and brush off the dirt with my fingers.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Based on the design, it must have belonged to a young woman.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Could it have been my sister's?",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I'll keep it as a memento.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Even though I still can't remember anything, nobody should mind this much.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"I return to where the others are.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Kotone has already assembled her altar and finished her preparations for the ritual.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry to keep you waiting. You can get started whenever\nyou're ready.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Very well. I shall begin right away.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"With a small nod, Kotone turns and faces the altar.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"I fall in behind her along with Akari and we attune our ears to the sound of Kotone's quiet voice.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Tens of thousands of lives were lost in this place.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Yet, this must be the first time a priestess has conducted a memorial service here since the war.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"How many warriors would shed their tears knowing that the Exalt-Priestess herself was here conducting this memorial?",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"I'm sure that all the warriors sleeping in this place will finally be put at ease.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(After we prevail over the Republic, let us hold another memorial service for the entire country.)”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Until that time comes, please let this be enough.)”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Silently, I make this heartfelt prayer.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Fireflies?”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"A wisp of light the size of my fingertip drifts past Akari's nose and soars into the sky.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"I check to make sure my eyes aren't playing any tricks on me.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What... in the world?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"As though taking my voice as a signal, the glimmers surrounding us gradually begin to disperse into the sky.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Wisps of light come forth from the ruins of my home, and\nHotori's as well.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"It looks as though these souls, bound here all this time, have finally been freed from their yoke.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Before we know it, we're engulfed by a vast fulgor of radiance.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"At a loss for words, all I can do is vacantly admire this miraculous vista.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It seems these souls have finally found the place they belong.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Kotone says, rising from her prayer.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“When death comes too suddenly, it may lead its victims astray.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Some souls are unable to recognize their death and linger as if they were still alive.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A memorial service also serves to convey the truth to such souls.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And finally, they've found salvation.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed they have, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All those people died here...”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Akari whispers, staring at the countless wisps of light as they disappear into the sky.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“About thirty thousand, I'm told.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've heard that number as well.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But now that I've seen these lights... I suddenly don't even know what to say.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"There is a world of difference between hearing the figure “thirty thousand” and seeing it with your own eyes.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I saw the Warrior District burning with my own two eyes that day.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“To think that all these people perished within those flames... and I couldn't do a single thing.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even so, that's hardly a burden you should have to bear.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But it's our family's duty to save the people, no matter how!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yet all I did was run away... and I even left you behind to cover my retreat.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Akari stares at me.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"She stares at me with eyebrows contorted in anguish as a raging fire burns within her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Out of the corner of my eye, I notice a peach petal fluttering down.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(There it is again.)”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"How could there be peach blossoms in a place like this?",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"I catch the falling petal in my hand.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"It slowly dissolves in my hand like melting snow.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kgh!”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Pain runs through my skull like a nail being rammed into it.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"─This petal of Persica.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"I've seen it somewhere before.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kghh!”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama!?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"My consciousness dissipates in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin? Soujin!?”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Akari's face is right in front of my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Did I collapse?",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A... Akari...”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's wrong? Are you okay?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know... My body's... losing its...”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, can you take a look at him?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Kotone holds her hands over me.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh!?”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“W-Well, I don't know how to even explain. The flow of his spellforce is a total mess.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Spellforce? What does she mean?)”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"I want to ask, but my voice refuses to come out.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Alright, I'll carry him.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Carry him?”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're getting out of here! We'll be in big trouble if the Republican Army finds us.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come on, let's move. Pack your stuff up.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hup!”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"I feel like I'm floating in midair.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Akari is carrying me on her back.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ngh... You're awfully heavy. Though I suppose I should thank you for training so much.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can walk... on my own...”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Say that with more energy and maybe I'll believe you.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, you ready?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes. I have finished tidying up.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Can you walk like that, Akari-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've got this Artifact, so I'll be fine.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Alright, let's get a move on!”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Akari starts moving.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Unable to resist, I'm carried along as dead weight.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Could there be any shame greater for a warrior than to be carried on his lord's back?",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Just abandon me...",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"Leave me here to perish in obscurity next to my fallen brothers and sisters.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"I plead again and again, but my mouth refuses to form the words.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"Droplets of rain begin to fall on my face.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, must it rain at a time like this?”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't let it get you down.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Make sure Soujin's body temperature doesn't drop.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, ma'am!”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Huh? What the?”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"I hear Akari gasp.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"Streaks of red lights flash across the edges of my vision.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"It's the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We've been spotted.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How could they have known we were here?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Those specks of light, probably.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My apologies. The souls were livelier than I had expected.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"They won't be able to get away from the Republican Army if they're dragging me around.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"I can't afford to hold them back any more than I already have.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari...”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Go on... without me...”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm only... holding you...”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Shut it. Stop talking.”",
			},
